.TH MASSSPRING 1
.SH NAME
massspring \- mass-spring sandbox
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/massspring
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I MassSpring
is a port of the TempleOS
.B Demo/Games/MassSpring.HC
sandbox.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Button 1 places masses; a button-2 drag connects two of them with a
spring.  Enter clears the world.  Everything after that belongs to the
ODE solver \- the masses and springs go into an
.IR ode (2)
system and it integrates them, so the two drag terms and the
acceleration limit are the only tuning there is.
.PP
It opens with the original's panel, typo and all: \fI"Left-Click to place
mas / Right-Click and drag to connect with spring. / Springs are 100 pixs
long."\fP  Any key dismisses it.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B LMB
Place mass
.TP
.B RMB drag
Connect spring between masses
.TP
.B Enter
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/massspring.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR ode (2),
.IR wm (1)
